  "title": "Finger play",
  "seconds": 8,
  "text": "Steps without windows come first: do what each one says with your fingers while the cameras record your hands. Then windows will appear in front of you: they don't move or click.|Press the button on the right side of the headset to start each step. Pressed while recording, it pauses."
 },
